{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Base directory for this skill: /private/tmp/sc-vague-a2/.claude/skills/meeting-actions\n\n# Meeting actions\n\nTurn meeting notes into a list of action items.\n\n## Format\n\nWrite `actions.md` with one action per line, in this shape:\n\n```\n- <owner> — <what> — by <when>\n```\n\nOwner is a first name. When is a weekday plus a date, or \"ongoing\".\nSkip anything that isn't a decision or a commitment.\n\n## Done\n\nEvery action has an owner, a what, and a when. No prose, no headings.\n\n\nARGUMENTS: notes.txt"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c64cfa4-3e7e-49ed-b319-f3532df37cfe","uuid":"394b494a-0c7d-4a13-a7eb-1344ef0770cb","timestamp":"2026-09-10T12:47:38.844Z","isSynthetic":true}
